<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-FRENCH CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FRENCH CUP FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of French Cup first round</p>
<p>matches on Sunday:</p>
<p> Schiltigheim (IV)     0  Strasbourg		4</p>
<p> Epinal (II)	     0  Troyes (II)	     0</p>
<p>(after extra time, Troyes won 6-5 on penalties)</p>
<p> Wasquehal (III)	 2  Amiens (II)	     2</p>
<p>(a.e.t., Wasquehal 5-3 on penalties)</p>
<p>Metz v  Montpellier postponed</p>
<p> Besancon (III)	  0  Paris St-Germain	3</p>
<p> Aurillac (IV)	   0  Villefranche (IV)     0</p>
<p>(a.e.t., Aurillac 6-5 on penalties)</p>
<p> Niort S.L. (minor)    1 Toulouse Fontaine (IV) 2 a.e.t.</p>
<p>Played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Sochaux (II)	    3  Nancy		     1 a.e.t.</p>
<p> Mont-de-Marsan (III)  0  Guingamp		  1 a.e.t.</p>
<p> Vitrolles (III)	 2  Nantes		    1 a.e.t.</p>
<p> Raon L'Etape (IV)     1  Toulouse (II)	   1</p>
<p>(a.e.t., Raon won 4-3 on penalties)</p>
<p> Aubervilliers (III)   1  Red Star (II)	   2</p>
<p> S-L Neuweg (minor)    0  Gueugnon (II)	   3</p>
<p> Paris FC (III)	  3  Poitiers (III)	  2</p>
<p> Clermont (IV)	   3  Lorient (II)	    2</p>
<p> Valence (II)	    0  Nice			1</p>
<p> Niort (II)		2  Le Havre		  1</p>
<p> Bourges (III)	   0  Lens			3</p>
<p> Brive (IV)		1  Bordeaux		  3 a.e.t.</p>
<p> La Roche-sur-Yon (IV) 2  Bastia		    4</p>
<p> Vitre (IV)		1  Lyon			3</p>
<p> Muret (IV)		1  Cannes		    2</p>
<p> Carquefou (V)	   0  Caen			1</p>
<p> Reims (V)		 2  Rennes		    3</p>
<p> Vervins (minor)	 0  Auxerre		   6</p>
<p> Creteil (III)	   5  Louhans-Cuiseaux (II) 0</p>
<p> Martigues (II)	  3  Istres (III)	    1</p>
<p> Saint-Lo (IV)	   1  Chateauroux (II)	1</p>
<p>(a.e.t., Saint-Lo won 3-1 on penalties)</p>
<p> Fecamp (III)	    4  Avranches (III)	 3</p>
<p> Armentieres (V)	 0  Boulogne (IV)	   3</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p> Laval (II)		1  Monaco		    0</p>
<p>Date to be fixed: Marseille v Lille</p>
</text>
